        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.14.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rum 14:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ompöwölo kighyongocha löwïr tawu ngacharu Kristo* nyo pö kirwok nyo mötïny atökurwokwecha nyinte. Kirwokyini chi anka tïkwïl kïrïp kegh nko ighisyewutkachi cho kigh ato ki karamach anta ki ghach.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kongotnön nko Tororöt ompö Kristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinkïtöcha nyu wölo kïtechtoy Echotyon anka nyoni kikilecha kegh akekïnkïnöy pich, nkïtecha Tororöt lasiny, akönan lö onkïtanïkwa tïkwïl ompö mïkuliskökwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Molenchï kegh kakimukyicha ngat keporï kegh ompö tawunkwa, wölo kïmökecha keporwokwa kïgh nyo keghecha kekwolenö kegh akwa, atömanyïl amuch owöghökyï pich cho kwolo kegh otöptöngwa nyo pö sany tya kïtïl wölo lata ompö mïkulöwekwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Töptoy kïlatecha pich cho kep oy, wölo kïlatecha choni ompö Tororöt, kwoto tenote kinonutköcha, kutenote lenyoni ompö tösunötenkwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompöwölo pöywecha chomnyo Kristo otï le ye kakenkïtucha lö kimegha chi akong pich löwïr, poru nyu nyoni lö kakupar pich tïkwïl meghenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimegha nyinte pich löwïr atökumï pich cho söpsot kïtagh kukön söpontöngwa kegh, wölo tökutwayta kegh Yeso nyo kima akututï ompö chane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Melö tökepimecha ye nyu chi anka tïkwïl ompö ara par, kïrkegh kimi ato kikipimacha Kristo ompö ara por, wölo melö tökeghecha ye nyu ngat lenyoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona nyu ato tuyö kegh chi anka tïkwïl nko Kristo kïkalïkwï nyinte ighan nyo rel, kikuwer ngala köny, ketï otöp nyo rel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ighöy Tororöt choni löwïr, nyo kelinyecha kelïkuna kongotichi ompö Kristo, akïkonecha achey nyo kilinyot tïkwïl pikö walaka nko nyinte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Poru nyoni lö kilinyö kegh Tororöt nko pich ompö Kristo amelö kitökuyityï Tororöt chane ngokikwa. Kökonecha kemwatïtena ngölyontononi kilinyot pich nko nyinte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïchicha nyu kighyongtoghi Kristo ompö ngwïnyinï cho pöghisyegho Tororöt kïsoghsoghokwa kuwerwecha. Kïmitecha kesoghokwa nyoman ompö Kristo lö olinyenö nko Tororöt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Melö kitïng Kristo ngokï, wölo kigh Tororöt nyinte kupar ngokicha atömanyïn kelïkwï pich cho tenote ompö Tororöt otini kakïtuyö nko nyinte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
